ields PASS.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The one-commit changed-path set is exactly the 19-path file-impact set.\n- [ ] Only the 51 declared prose blocks and adjacent blank lines change.\n- [ ] The normalized non-docstring AST is identical on every impacted path.\n- [ ] Runtime strings and non-allowlisted comments remain byte-identical.\n- [ ] Directive and shebang physical lines remain byte-identical and attached.\n- [ ] The independent TSV has exactly 51 passing rows.\n- [ ] Every recorded focused DD command passes; Gerrit `Verified +1` supplies the repository-wide suite per operator direction.\n"}},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1789048629612303001,"uuid":"fab7e819-c2eb-40ce-bc15-cb42a0428c16"}